flowchart TD
  Create[User or backend creates object] --> Quota[Preflight and atomic quota enforcement]
  Quota --> Private[Private owner-prefixed Storage]
  Private --> Row[Owner-scoped database metadata]
  Row --> Kind{Assistant output media?}
  Kind -->|No| Retain[Normal lifecycle and user deletion]
  Kind -->|Yes| Descriptor[Generate safe text descriptor]
  Descriptor --> DescriptorStore[Upload private descriptor]
  DescriptorStore --> Queue[Mark descriptor ready in retention queue]
  Queue --> Due{Delete-after reached and no hold/error?}
  Due -->|No| Retry[Retry or retain]
  Due -->|Yes| Delete[Idempotently delete original binary]
  Delete --> Receipt[Record completion]
  Descriptor -. failure .-> NeverDelete[No descriptor means no source deletion]
  Retain --> Rights[Range, all-content or account deletion]
  Retry --> Rights
  Rights --> Local[Also purge local backend state]
